{"name":"Grandmacore","title":"Grandmacore","revision":232280,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Grandmacore","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Grandmacore refers to an aesthetic that is based around cottage and stereotypical grandma-related things such as gardening, soft knitted fabric, crocheting, farmland animals, fresh baked bread, and other visuals."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Visuals"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knitting and balls of yarn in baskets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Lots of baked goods and sweets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Probably a rocking or armchair in the corner by a fireplace"},{"kind":"list","text":"Doilies"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old novelty teapots, plates, or vases"},{"kind":"list","text":"Fake floral arrangements"},{"kind":"list","text":"Brightly colored old furniture (sometimes covered in plastic)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Kitschy trinkets or novelty items centering on a theme unique to the individual (cats, lighthouses, flowers, etc.)"},{"kind":"list","text":"House organized in a very particular way"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Fashion"},{"kind":"list","text":"Cozy jumpers (hand-knitted)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Old dresses (hand-made)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Knitted cardigans (hand-knitted)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Aprons"},{"kind":"list","text":"Long skirts"},{"kind":"list","text":"Slippers"},{"kind":"list","text":"White hair pulled back neatly"},{"kind":"list","text":"Older jewelry such as brooches, matching sets, old rings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Faded bathrobes"},{"kind":"list","text":"Long cotton or flannel nightgowns"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Criticism"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"Under Construction"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/c/c4/Knitting_grandma_sweater.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20210128210725","caption":"Knitting grandma sweater","source":"h